      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Нельзя измерить любовь.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "С отелями всё гораздо проще. Чем больше звёзд, тем лучше сервис.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "And that brings Episode Ten of Season Five to a warm finish. Listen for Max's closing reflection that you cannot measure friendship, loyalty, or love, unlike hotel star ratings. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Пока!",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
